Z||000003||stimpy||07-07-2000||07:04 AM||||Those are Canadian db. That equates out to about 114db U.S.<P>My Phase Linear 200 cost about $70 at Circuit City. It's adequate, that's it. My suggestion is to check out Circuit City and Good Guys for open box items.  You can usually save a bunch buying items that don't have orignal packaging. They still have original warranty, too.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://gifs123.tripod.com/page15/renstimpy2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Formula||07-07-2000||10:11 AM||||I'm currently running a Jensen 300watt/400watt bridged 2 channel amplifier on my sony Xplode 10". Its around $100 and they last forever.  (I bought 1 around 3 years ago to run my 4 12s off of (136db) then I sold it for $50 (which it still works) then he sold it for $75! And then another friend bought a new one and ran (guess what) 4 12s off of it and he still has it, then another friend bought 2 and ran 2 kicker comp 10s and guess what, they're still going strong, and I bought my current Jensen amp for $100 (300w/400w bridged) for the Fiero about a year ago and it overheated once when I had it full blast (gains up all the way, stereo up all the way) for about 4 hours.......And it still is running strong, btw the Jenses series sounds best with a 4 volt input from the rcas, I recently replaced my 3 year old Jensen cd player with a new $300 Alpine and it made a noticeable difference in the subs excursion.....<P>Buy Jensen, Live Long........||||reg||1
Z||000005||Oreif||07-07-2000||11:12 AM||||I have an Optimus 2X85 or 1X170 for sale on Yahoo Auctions. Presently it is at $35.00.<BR>It makes a great subwoofer amp because it has a 6db bass boost at 75hz. It is a class "A" amp and can go down to 2 ohms in Bridged mode at 350W. I used it for a year as a sub amp. Now I am using a powered Bazooka tube for my sub. (less space is taken up)It normally sells for $159.00<BR>You can Check it out at: <A HREF="http://page.auctions.yahoo.com/auction/30406575" TARGET=_blank>http://page.auctions.yahoo.com/auction/30406575</A> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 07-07-2000).]||||reg||1
