Z||000007||86SE||07-07-2000||01:57 PM||||Jensen has GREAT customer service!<P>I bought a Jensen XA1120 220w amp for about $80 new.  Used it for about 6 months BRIDGED into 2 ohms (its lowest stable rating is 4 ohms).  It got super hot!  One day it quit working, fried, called Jensen and they gave me the address to send it to.  I sent it in, 4 weeks later a brand new one showed up in the mail!<P>Im a Jensen fan now.  I still havent used the new one yet, still sittin in the box.  Now im using a Autotek Competition amp.||||reg||14
