Z||000010||86SE||07-08-2000||12:26 AM||||I would sell it to you, but I feel that it would be WAY underpowered for your sub.  I hooked it up to a 200w  12" sub, and it did not push it at all!  The cone moved at most .25".<P>If you look on E-bay, do a search for "800 watt amp".  I always find some guy selling about 20 or so Pyrimid 800 watt bridgeable amp for $90.  Excellent price for its power, and you will be using only half of it so even thoe its cheap it will still last a while.||||reg||11
